      "text": "(e) Act for, on behalf of and at the direction of the Mayor in the exercise of all func-\ntions, powers and duties which the Mayor may have pursuant to the New York City\nSeasonal Financing Act of 1975, Public Law 94-143, as the same may be from time to time\namended, and a credit agreement made thereunder as of December 30, 1975 by and among\nthe United States of America on the one hand and the State of New York, The City of\nNew York and the New York State Emergency Financial Control Board on the other\nhand, including, but not limited to, full power to execute for, on behalf of, and at the direc-\ntion of the Mayor, any document pursuant to such agreement and any agreement, amend-\nment to agreement or other document pursuant to such law. The exercise of functions,\npowers and duties for, on behalf of and at the direction of the Mayor by such Deputy Mayor\npursuant to this delegation shall not require the consent in writing of the Mayor or any\nother official of the City.",
